(ONE_GMS VERCEL DEPLOYMENT GUIDE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This guide summarizes the Vercel deployment approach that worked for the ONE_GMS frontend) Tj
T*
(and backend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Deploy the backend and frontend as two separate Vercel projects.) Tj
T*
(- Backend project name: `one-gms-api`) Tj
T*
(- Frontend project name: `one-gms`) Tj
T*
(- Backend production API base URL: `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app`) Tj
T*
(- Frontend production app URL: `https://one-gms.vercel.app`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Backend lives in the `backend` folder and is deployed as a FastAPI project.) Tj
T*
(- Frontend lives in the `frontend` folder and is deployed as a Vite project.) Tj
T*
(- Frontend calls the backend through `VITE_API_BASE_URL`.) Tj
T*
(- Frontend should use the backend root URL only, not Swagger docs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Correct frontend production value:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://one-gms-api.vercel.app) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Incorrect values:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000) Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://one-gms-api.vercel.app/docs) Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_BASE_URL=VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://one-gms-api.vercel.app) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Backend Deployment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Create the Backend Vercel Project) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Create a new Vercel project for the `backend` folder.) Tj
T*
(- Set the project root directory to `backend`.) Tj
T*
(- Use the `FastAPI` framework preset if Vercel detects it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Backend Build Settings) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use these settings:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Framework Preset: `FastAPI`) Tj
T*
(- Install Command: `pip install -r requirements.vercel.txt`) Tj
T*
(- Build Command: `alembic upgrade head`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The file `requirements.vercel.txt` is used to keep the Vercel Python runtime dependencies) Tj
T*
(smaller and more deployment-friendly.) Tj
ET
endstream
