T*
(This prevents `400 Invalid host header` on production Vercel requests.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Backend Verification) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These are normal checks:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app/docs` should load Swagger UI) Tj
T*
(- opening `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app/api/v1/auth/login` directly in a browser returns) Tj
T*
(  `405 Method Not Allowed`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(That `405` is expected because the login endpoint is a `POST` endpoint, not a browser) Tj
T*
(`GET` endpoint.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Frontend Deployment) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Create the Frontend Vercel Project) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Create a separate Vercel project for the `frontend` folder.) Tj
T*
(- Set the project root directory to `frontend`.) Tj
T*
(- Use the `Vite` framework preset.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Frontend Environment Variables) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use these values:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For local development in `frontend/.env`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000) Tj
T*
(    VITE_API_VERSION=v1) Tj
T*
(    VITE_APP_DEBUGGING=true) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For the Vercel frontend production environment:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Name: `VITE_API_BASE_URL`) Tj
T*
(- Value: `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- do not include `/docs`) Tj
T*
(- do not include the variable name inside the value field) Tj
T*
(- the Vercel value field must contain only the URL) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Why `localhost` Worked Before) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`http://localhost:8000` works only when:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- the frontend is running locally on your machine) Tj
ET
