(Final Working Checklist) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Backend) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Vercel project root is `backend`) Tj
T*
(- Install command is `pip install -r requirements.vercel.txt`) Tj
T*
(- Build command is `alembic upgrade head`) Tj
T*
(- `backend/app.py` adds the backend folder to `sys.path`) Tj
T*
(- `backend/src/mail.py` avoids writing inside the read-only deployment tree) Tj
T*
(- `backend/src/templates/.gitkeep` exists) Tj
T*
(- `backend/src/middleware.py` allows Vercel hosts) Tj
T*
(- Swagger works at `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app/docs`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Frontend) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Vercel project root is `frontend`) Tj
T*
(- frontend production env uses `https://one-gms-api.vercel.app`) Tj
T*
(- local `.env` can still use `http://localhost:8000`) Tj
T*
(- frontend normalization code is present) Tj
T*
(- frontend is redeployed after env var changes) Tj
T*
(- login requests go to the backend domain, not localhost) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
